# With an empty library there is no top card: the Botanist's trigger looks at nothing and asks nothing (CR 701.20a). The deck is eight cards, so the turn 3 draw empties the library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Traveling Botanist
Island x5
Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Traveling Botanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Traveling Botanist > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot2.Life = 18
